        \Gamma L^2_{}
    \else
        \Gamma H^{}_{}
    \fi
$, the operator ${\mathfrak S}$ is essentially self-adjoint while $({\mathfrak A}_+)^* = - {\mathfrak A}_-$ and $({\mathfrak A}_0)^* = - {\mathfrak A}_0$. Observe that, for any $n \geq 0$, the operators ${\mathfrak S}$, ${\mathfrak A}_+$, ${\mathfrak A}_-$, ${\mathfrak A}_0$ map $
